## Provenance

None of these assets are third-party works.

The cast atlases, portraits, enemy atlases, room backdrops, and audio are
copies of material committed by the four source games — Legend of Kilix,
Chumrunner, Kilix Fantasy, and Pleb Bound — kept byte-identical by
`tools/sync_source_parity.py`. Those games are separate projects by the same
author, and several of them are not public. The copies here are offered under
this license; that grant covers these copies only and does not enlarge any
rights in the source games themselves.

`assets/graphics/PROMPTS.md` records the prompts behind originally generated
images, and `assets/graphics/manifest.json` their hashes.
